	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z5"/>S<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Cogor eorum rogatu, qui consilio meo non obtemperant, <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>tibi molestus esse, venerande frater.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Coniectus fuit in carcerem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>bonus quidam vir <placeName ref="l306">Mediolani</placeName>, quia liberius contra impietatem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>papatus loquutus fuerat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Est quidem <placeName ref="l631">Burgundio</placeName>, sed qui dudum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>in hac urbe habitat et in <placeName ref="l834">Italia</placeName> negotiatur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Paratus quidem <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>fuiset senatus noster pro ipso deprecari; sed quia ludibrio <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>habitae fuissent literae, abstinuit.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Dedi consilium, quod <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>repudiarunt amici eius; putarunt enim, si quatuor civitates <lb xml:id="p1z14"/><placeName ref="l862">Helveticae</placeName>, quae puram evangelii doctrinam profitentur, <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>pro ipso intercederent, <placeName ref="l306">Mediolanenses</placeName> vix quicquam ausuros.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z16"/>Atqui vereor, ne vestrorum quoque authoritas hac in parte <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>levis et prope nullius momenti futura sit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Quia tamen <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>causa ipsa non vulgarem commendationem meretur, etiam <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>atque etiam te rogo, ut nuntium in literis impetrandis, qua <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>poteris fide et diligentia, adiuves.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale, clarissime vir <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>et honorande frater.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Dominus te gubernet suo spiritu, <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>virtute sustineat ac incolumem conservet!</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l167">Genevae</placeName> 9. <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>septembris 1562.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Tu<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>us <persName ref="p540">Iohannes Calvinus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[nur Unterschrift aut.:]</note>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Clarissimo viro d. <persName ref="p495">Henricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinae</placeName> ecclesiae fidelissimo pastori, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>fratri et symmystae observando.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
